{"unit_id":"rqzhao1__dsh-wsl-launcher#feature-1","repo":"rqzhao1/dsh-wsl-launcher","commit":"b6ef9200c73b0f021542669b5aaebb34e39a2e78","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-launcher 的功能「桌面快捷启动」：在 WSL 环境中创建启动脚本和 Windows 桌面快捷方式；点击快捷方式会在后台启动 dsh web 并打开默认浏览器，服务已运行时可复用现有端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113-152","lib/launcher.js:443-476","lib/launcher.js:537-588"]}
{"unit_id":"rqzhao1__dsh-wsl-launcher#feature-2","repo":"rqzhao1/dsh-wsl-launcher","commit":"b6ef9200c73b0f021542669b5aaebb34e39a2e78","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-launcher 的功能「启动器管理」：调用 wsl_launcher 工具执行 install、status、open、stop 或 uninstall，以管理快捷方式、查看状态、打开页面、停止启动器启动的服务或卸载文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-175","lib/index.js:195-300"]}
{"unit_id":"rqzhao1__dsh-wsl-launcher#feature-3","repo":"rqzhao1/dsh-wsl-launcher","commit":"b6ef9200c73b0f021542669b5aaebb34e39a2e78","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-launcher 的功能「浏览器关闭后自动停止」：启用 autostop 后，Web 客户端定期报告标签页在线状态；服务端在达到最短运行时间且超过空闲宽限期、没有标签页或 WebSocket 连接时结束 DSH Web。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:9-58","lib/autostop.js:174-220"]}
